# engine.conf.d — drop-in overrides (#4)

Files ending in `.conf` in this directory load after `engine.conf`, in byte
order; later files win. Dotfiles, non-`.conf` names and non-regular files are
skipped. This file exists only to explain the directory and is itself skipped.

Example: `/var/lib/sandbox-engine/config/engine.conf.d/10-pool.conf`

    # Local pool tuning; survives package upgrades of engine.conf.
    pool_size = 8

`[template "NAME"]` sections in any layer apply only when NAME is the
effective template (see docs/CONFIGURATION.md).
